<%- include('../partials/header',{title}) %><section class="admin-shell"><div class="container"><%- include('../partials/lmu-admin-heading',{title}) %><%- include('../partials/lmu-season-picker') %>
<p>Termine dieser Saison bearbeiten. Bestehende Ergebnisse bleiben erhalten. Sobald Aufstellungen oder Fahrerwechsel vorliegen, können neue Rennen nur hinten ergänzt werden.</p>
<% if(season){const rounds=events.length?events:[{}]; %><form method="post" action="/admin/lmu-season-calendar/<%= season.id %>" class="resource-form" data-lmu-calendar><input type="hidden" name="version" value="<%= version %>">
<div data-lmu-rounds><% rounds.forEach((row,index)=>{ %><div class="lmu-calendar-round" data-lmu-round><input type="hidden" name="rounds[r<%= index %>][id]" data-field="id" value="<%= row.id||'' %>"><strong data-round-label>Termin <%= index+1 %></strong><label>Titel<input name="rounds[r<%= index %>][title]" data-field="title" value="<%= row.title||'' %>" required maxlength="255"></label><label>Strecke<input name="rounds[r<%= index %>][circuit]" data-field="circuit" value="<%= row.circuit||'' %>" required maxlength="255"></label><label>Datum / Uhrzeit (Berlin)<input type="datetime-local" name="rounds[r<%= index %>][startsAt]" data-field="startsAt" value="<%= localDateTime(row.startsAt) %>" required></label><label><input type="checkbox" name="rounds[r<%= index %>][isTestDay]" data-field="isTestDay" <%= row.isTestDay?'checked':'' %>> Testtag (ohne Wertung)</label><div><button type="button" data-round-up aria-label="Termin nach oben">↑</button><button type="button" data-round-down aria-label="Termin nach unten">↓</button><button type="button" data-round-remove>Entfernen</button></div></div><% }); %></div>
<button type="button" class="button button-ghost" data-round-add>+ Termin hinzufügen</button><button class="button">Saisonkalender speichern</button></form><% } %></div></section><script src="/js/lmu-admin.js" defer></script><%- include('../partials/footer') %>